diff --git a/crates/rightkit-tauri-shell/CHANGELOG.md b/crates/rightkit-tauri-shell/CHANGELOG.md
index dad91a0..c061566 100644
--- a/crates/rightkit-tauri-shell/CHANGELOG.md
